# SpireVault Showtime — Innovation 2 (live spectator + tournaments + race)
# Each new feature lives at <feature>/index.html so Cloudflare Pages
# auto-serves it on /<feature> (with a 308 to /<feature>/). Deep-link
# share URLs use query params (?runId=, ?slug=, ?date=) instead of
# path segments — Pages's _redirects splat rules with status 200
# don't reliably override the SPA fallback for unknown nested paths,
# so the canonical share format stays in querystring-land.

/overlay   /index.html   200
